<title>UK: GOLF-WPGA CHAMPIONSHIP OF EUROPE LEADING SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WPGA CHAMPIONSHIP OF EUROPE LEADING SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>GLENEAGLES, Scotland 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores from</p>
<p>the first round of the women's WPGA championship of Europe on</p>
<p>Thursday (British unless stated):</p>
<p>66 Lora Fairclough</p>
<p>67 Wendy Dicks, Trish Johnson, Catriona Matthew</p>
<p>68 Marie-Laure de Lorenzi (France), Anna Radford</p>
<p>69 Helend Wadsworth, Karen Lunn (Australia), Alison</p>
<p>Nicholas, Janice Moodie, Fiona Pike (Australia)</p>
<p>First round to be completed on Friday.</p>
